{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","伊戈尔"],["/names/en","Igor"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名灵巧的战士，在墓碑间跳跃造成范围伤害。"],["/description_i18n/en","An agile Warrior who can jump between tombstones to deal AoE damage."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","把战场变成墓园吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Let's turn the battlefield into a cemetery!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","坟墓生活变得更丰富多彩了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Let's have more folks join the celebration!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","埋葬！然后焚烧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Bury... and then burn!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我得到下头去了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I must go... down..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","在这上头玩火特别有意思，试试看？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Haha, piece of cake!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","墓穴上方是墓碑，墓碑上方——是我！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Above the grave stands the tombstone. Above the tombstone—stands me!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","穩住，穩住。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hey! Steady on now! Steady on!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","活着的时候，你说什么。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","This little old brain remembers a lot!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","Woo！Yahoo！看著吧！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Ye-ho! Watch this!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嘿！这么棒的东西，该埋到下头陪我！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Such a fine specimen should be buried below to keep me company!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哈，有意思！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Ha! Interesting..."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","墓园幽火"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Graveyard Ghostfire"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","在死寂与幽暗中，腾跃而出的火焰与身影——以及欢笑。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","In the dark stillness, flames and silhouettes leap with laughter."],["/skins/0/provenance/localization/Name/languages/en",{"source":"luae_map","source_file":"luae_translation_map_en.csv","pair_order":"26484"}],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","南瓜恶灵"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Pumpkin Spirit"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","秋夜节的夜晚，诡异的南瓜恶灵将大笑着展开恶作剧的狂欢。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","The spooky pumpkin spirit will laugh gleefully as it kicks off a night of mischief during the Fall Harvest Festival."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","活动秋海启航达成特定条件获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Golden Voyage"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我能跳到桌子上吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Can I jump on the table?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","要是多几座墓碑就好了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","If only there were a couple more tombstones here!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哈！吓一跳了吧！！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Ha! Did I give you a good scare?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来吧，雪中捉迷藏！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Come on, let's play hide and seek in the snow!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我是了不起的雪人！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'll be the best snowman!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哈，怪兽！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Ha, a monster!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呀哈！看我的火！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Look at my fire! Yoohoo!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","据说，雪松镇一带会有亡灵偷偷混进活人中，然后突然吓他们一跳。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","They say that the Graveborn like to hide among the living in Cedartown, only to scare them when they least expect it."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","伊戈尔的身上有诸多谜团，连伊戈尔的伙伴都不知道他生前来自何方，经历了什么。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Igor is completely shrouded in mystery; even his own companions are ignorant of his origins and history."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","曾有人计算过，伊戈尔的一跳最远可以跨越5个墓碑。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","According to one person, Igor can leap as far as five tombstones in a single bound."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","伊戈尔喜欢哼歌，但他的曲调和歌词就像是把五十首歌切碎了又胡乱拼成，没有人能听出他在唱什么。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Igor enjoys humming tunes to himself, though the lyrics and melodies seem to be a strange amalgamation of countless other songs. As a result, no one can ever name the song he is singing."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","伊戈尔喜欢和小孩玩闹，常追着颜色鲜艳的气球和风车跑，被遇到的成年人视为梦魇。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Igor likes playing with children and is rather fond of balloons and pinwheels. Unfortunately, this sight only inspires fear in the hearts of adults."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说，伊戈尔成为亡灵后，亲自扒开了自己的坟墓，他却不记得自己生前执着的事情究竟是什么了。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","They say that after becoming a Graveborn, Igor personally dug up his own grave. Apparently, he has no recollection of his past life or the things he has done."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","伊戈尔常常出没于雪松镇外的墓园，但有时，人们会发现人迹罕至的荒坟前会摆上新摘下的鲜花。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Igor tends to haunt the graveyard outside of Cedartown, where people will sometimes find freshly-picked flowers lying on top of long-forgotten graves."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","不少亡灵猎人怀疑伊戈尔和那个寻求生命力的亡灵组织有关，后来发现伊戈尔的神出鬼没只是因为他喜好如此。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Several undead hunters believed that Igor shared a close connection with a certain power-hungry Graveborn group, only to discover that he simply enjoys being secretive."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","“那天我觉得自己被跟踪了……回头一看，一个亡灵就扑上来了！然后……把我帽子上的穗拔走了？”一位雪松镇镇民如此说。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","\"One day, I felt like I was being followed... When I turned around, a Graveborn jumped out at me! And then, it snatched the tassel from my hat and ran off!\"—Testimony from a resident of Cedartown."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","伊戈尔身形很高大，总是弓着腰是因为他的朋友们几乎都很矮小，对伊戈尔来说，这样才更有一起玩闹的乐趣。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Igor's unusually tall stature means that he has to hunch over to play with his friends, most of whom are rather short. For Igor, this only adds to the fun."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，你们！不要挡住我的墓碑！"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Hey, don't block my tombstone!"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep3/herohub_story/13411280.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep3/herohub_story/13411280.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","伊戈尔 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Igor & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","我能跳到桌子上吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Can I jump on the table?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415128.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415128.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","伊戈尔"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Igor"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","哈！吓一跳了吧！！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Ha! Did I give you a good scare?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415129.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415129.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","伊戈尔"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Igor"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","来吧，雪中捉迷藏！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Come on, let's play hide and seek in the snow!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415439.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415439.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","伊戈尔"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Igor"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","我是了不起的雪人！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","I'll be the best snowman!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415440.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415440.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","伊戈尔"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Igor"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","伊戈尔？可算找到你了，你怎么跑到这里来了？"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Igor. There you are. What are you doing here?"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415481.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415481.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","瓦丽卡 & 伊戈尔"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Valka & Igor"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","哈，怪兽！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Ha, a monster!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415615.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415615.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","伊戈尔"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Igor"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","呀哈！看我的火！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Look at my fire! Yoohoo!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415616.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415616.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","伊戈尔"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Igor"]]}